<title>ARGENTINA: Argentine builders to announce $25 bln projects.</title>
<headline>Argentine builders to announce $25 bln projects.</headline>
<dateline>BUENOS AIRES 1997-06-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Argentina's construction industry chamber (CAC) said it will soon announce a $25 billion combined private and public investment program over the next three to five years.</p>
<p>CAC chairman Aldo Roggio said in comments published by local media Wednesday that his group was &quot;working on a plan for infrastructure in roads, water and sewage, housing, health and education.&quot;</p>
<p>&quot;We're talking about an investment on the order of $25 billion,&quot; Roggio was quoted as saying.</p>
<p>(( -- Buenos Aires Newsroom +541 318-0695))</p>
